  "description": "Flynn is an upbeat fox selling homemade beverages to make money. While he’s looked down upon as a petty vendor from a cunning species, Flynn is determined to live an honest life while searching for his long-lost brother. However, when he catches the eye of the wealthy dragon Hugo, Flynn finds himself forced to become a pawn in a game of political chess where his brother’s life is on the line. Now, Flynn must give up his honest life and trick Hugo into a sweet trap… But can he really outfox the skeptical dragon?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
